                                                "sense_id": "fda9d94b-4b1e-3680-97be-270fb0b1cf22",
                                                "text": "Though not poisonous, this mildly psychoactive mushroom has valuable medicinal properties. Extracted agents could be used to enhance medi-gels pain-reducing capabilities."
